=== wpa_cli vendor_elem_add ===
add vendor specific IEs to frame(s) 0: Probe Req (P2P), 1: Probe Resp (P2P)
, 2: Probe Resp (GO), 3: Beacon (GO), 4: PD Req, 5: PD Resp, 6: GO Neg Req,
7: GO Neg Resp, 8: GO Neg Conf, 9: Inv Req, 10: Inv Resp, 11: Assoc Req
(P2P), 12: Assoc Resp (P2P)

=== wpa_cli vendor_elem_get ===
get vendor specific IE(s) to frame(s) 0: Probe Req (P2P), 1: Probe Resp
(P2P) , 2: Probe Resp (GO), 3: Beacon (GO), 4: PD Req, 5: PD Resp, 6: GO Neg
Req, 7: GO Neg Resp, 8: GO Neg Conf, 9: Inv Req, 10: Inv Resp, 11: Assoc Req
(P2P), 12: Assoc Resp (P2P)

=== wpa_cli vendor_elem_remove ===
remove vendor specific IE(s) in frame(s) 0: Probe Req (P2P), 1: Probe Resp
(P2P) , 2: Probe Resp (GO), 3: Beacon (GO), 4: PD Req, 5: PD Resp, 6: GO Neg
Req, 7: GO Neg Resp, 8: GO Neg Conf, 9: Inv Req, 10: Inv Resp, 11: Assoc Req
(P2P), 12: Assoc Resp (P2P)

